{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is trisected by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> which meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/4148ada6df29725e539c170b469dfaef0cfe1fb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) \\ }\\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{AE}{DC}  \\qquad \\textbf{(B) \\ }\\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{AB}{BC} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) \\ }\\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{BD}{BE} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"462\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4f8f219a1e6aeab2a637b1411d765f62224bac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) \\ }\\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{(AB)(BD)}{(BE)(BC)} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) \\ }\\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{(AE)(BD)}{(DC)(BE)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"411\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/750cf2dc2dad7d03ac8152cec972922ed06bb7c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import olympiad; pair A=(0,0), B=(3,3), C=(6,0), D=(2,0), E=(4,0); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); dot(E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(5.5,0),E); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,S); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(B--D); draw(B--E); markscalefactor=0.1; draw(anglemark(A,B,D)); draw(anglemark(D,B,E)); draw(anglemark(E,B,C)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"148\" />\nUsing the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle_Bisector_Theorem\" title=\"Angle Bisector Theorem\">Angle Bisector Theorem</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb4154a7111a70c199f4bf120ec2ae21be5e8dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68e80c71d8f08383352a558a07cd96d6c6fa293f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2af8f51b0d8d90626cac50dc29f93c411781709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AD}{DE}=\\frac{AB}{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe0df1db2f6e2f28174541488309c688d43504a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{DE}{EC}=\\frac{BD}{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"90\" height=\"37\" />. Rewriting this to better fit our answer choices gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddddaf9cdbaac3741501501b88a6a62cc8991d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=\\frac{(DE)(AB)}{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb9ec9bcdb085f2997faa9142b3fd08873d55740.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC=\\frac{(DE)(BC)}{BD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"38\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b455b27579d59e7dace163477927d4a538472e6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{(DE)(AB)}{BE}\\cdot \\frac{BD}{(DE)(BC)}\\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{AD}{EC}=\\frac{(AB)(BD)}{(BE)(BC)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"497\" height=\"54\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title